[node name="InstructionsText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1791410744]
unique_name_in_owner = true
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Setup[/b]
After the main menu, you will be prompted to enter the names of every player.
Enter the names and confirm to begin the game.

[b]The Game[/b]
There are 5 rounds:
1. Every round, you and the others will be shown the name of a disease.
2. The objective is to determine where in the world the disease was first identified.
3. You will take turns entering your answer by placing a pin on the map.
- Before your turn, there will be a privacy screen with a confirmation prompt. Make sure no one else is looking so they don't cheat off of you!
4. Pan and zoom around the map to get a precise placement for your pin.
5. Confirm the pin's placement, and pass the device on to the next player on the screen.
6. After every player has placed a pin, the location of the disease is revealed with a golden pin.
7. Alongside the answer, an educational fact about the disease is revealed. Be sure to remember them to help you out later!

[b]Scoring[/b]
The closer your guess is to the disease's location, the more points you earn.

[b]Winning[/b]
Remain as precise as possible to gain the most points. The player(s) with the most points win!"

